{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Start with a handful of soldiers and rise to become a lord who shakes the battlefield!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War of Banners is a strategy real-time combat RPG set in a medieval world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast, living world freely\u2014recruit and train your own order of knights, lead them into battle, and conquer new territories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than just combat; every soldier's life matters, and each choice you make can shift the tide of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small skirmishes turn into grand stories, all shaped by your decisions and command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the weight of realistic warfare and the thrill of player-driven tactics in War of Banners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Vast Medieval World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel freely across a sprawling continent and encounter diverse factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with raiders, knightly orders, merchant guilds, and warring kingdoms\u2014or remain neutral and forge your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Mercenary Management</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire and train mercenaries, equip them for battle, and prepare for every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soldiers can rise in ranks, fall in combat, or even betray you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Unit Command</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once battle begins, take direct control of your units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From individual soldiers to entire formations, every command is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Politics and Power</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture cities, collect taxes, forge alliances, or declare war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even a single player can change the course of the world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3869940?t=1769992884","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869940/ad7fac875e41bc0d0cd63f6866b875be7d1e3044/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769992884","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869940/242aacdecff95ace39e46fc76bba5896d2785f2d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769992884","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869940/242aacdecff95ace39e46fc76bba5896d2785f2d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769992884","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3912710,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Start with a handful of soldiers and rise to become a lord who shakes the battlefield!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >War of Banners is a strategy real-time combat RPG set in a medieval world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast, living world freely\u2014recruit and train your own order of knights, lead them into battle, and conquer new territories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is more than just combat; every soldier's life matters, and each choice you make can shift the tide of war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small skirmishes turn into grand stories, all shaped by your decisions and command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the weight of realistic warfare and the thrill of player-driven tactics in War of Banners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Vast Medieval World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel freely across a sprawling continent and encounter diverse factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage with raiders, knightly orders, merchant guilds, and warring kingdoms\u2014or remain neutral and forge your own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Mercenary Management</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire and train mercenaries, equip them for battle, and prepare for every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soldiers can rise in ranks, fall in combat, or even betray you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Unit Command</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once battle begins, take direct control of your units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From individual soldiers to entire formations, every command is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Politics and Power</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture cities, collect taxes, forge alliances, or declare war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even a single player can change the course of the world.</p>","developers":["Jackto Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869940/00b75e42e7d4c158d65b02c293d5b1908f4741c4/header.jpg?t=1769992884","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3869940/1256225133/19b29b8400e779d371afce975f0af5507e200ab9/1760319631/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760320240","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3869940/125622513